Validate the attached fit against the fitting rules: turret/launcher hardpoint limits, module-vs-ship group/type restrictions, rig size compatibility, duplicate booster slots, charge size/capacity/group compatibility, missing charges, mutually exclusive active module groups, ship resource limits (powergrid, CPU, rig calibration), drone limits (bandwidth, bay volume, max active drones), fighter limits (tube count, per-category squadron slots), and modules set to a state above their supported maximum. Returns errors and warnings; an empty list means the fit is legal.
